Name:         cached-pipeline
Version:      0.1.0
Description:  A cached, deterministic prefix; a cached task whose upstream changes every run.
Created:      2026-01-02T03:04:05Z

INPUT  TYPE    DEFAULT  REQUIRED
rows   number  1000     -

TASK       USES   NEEDS            TIMEOUT
featurize  shell  -                300s
stamp      shell  -                300s
train      shell  featurize,stamp  300s

CACHED     TTL             SCOPE
featurize  24h             orkflow
train      deployment cap  orkflow
